  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onions, carrots, and celery and cook until they are softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the rolled oats and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the oat milk, salt, black pepper, and dried thyme, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and serve hot."
